      "cooked": "<div>On Saturday July 18th, The Board Room Game Cafe is hosting a Sentinel Tactics tournament. There are prizes to be had!</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>If you're interested in learning how to play the game, I'm hosting a learn to play session this afternoon (Saturday July 11th), and we have a regular Sentinels night Monday at 7 pm as well. Both of these events are at The Board Room. If you can't make either but are still interested in learning, let me know and perhaps we can arrange another time this week.</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>Tournament event (Saturday July 18th):</div><div>https://www.facebook.com/events/887176721355976/</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>Learn to play event (Saturday July 11th - TODAY):</div><div>https://www.facebook.com/events/1145900215423785/</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>Next Sentinels Night (Monday July 13th):</div><div>https://www.facebook.com/events/650519061744641/</div><div>&nbsp;</div>",
